<h1>Task Management System — How To Work (Detailed)</h1>
<p class="meta">Project: TaskManagement &nbsp;|&nbsp; Base URL: http://localhost:6065 &nbsp;|&nbsp; Document Type: Full Working Guide with All Entries</p>

<div class="box toc">
<strong>Contents</strong>
<ol>
  <li>Project Introduction &amp; Tech Stack</li>
  <li>Roles &amp; Permissions</li>
  <li>Login Process (How Login Works)</li>
  <li>Session Management</li>
  <li>Logout Process</li>
  <li>Dashboard Working</li>
  <li>User Management (All Entries)</li>
  <li>Task Management (All Entries)</li>
  <li>Deleted Tasks &amp; Rollback</li>
  <li>Excel Upload / Export</li>
  <li>Audit Report &amp; Audit Entry Switch</li>
