<!-- ===================== 15 ===================== -->
<h2>15. Database Tables</h2>
<table>
  <tr><th>Table</th><th>Entity</th><th>Purpose</th></tr>
  <tr><td>Tbl_UserLogin</td><td>UserEntity</td><td>Users, roles, passwords, active flag</td></tr>
  <tr><td>tbl_tasks</td><td>TaskEntity</td><td>Tasks; soft delete via isActive</td></tr>
  <tr><td>tbl_audit</td><td>AuditEntity</td><td>Audit trail</td></tr>
  <tr><td>tbl_mail_log</td><td>MailLog</td><td>Email send history</td></tr>
  <tr><td>tbl_mail_template</td><td>MailTemplate</td><td>Email HTML templates</td></tr>
  <tr><td>tbl_mail_setting</td><td>MailSetting</td><td>Mail Send / CC / Audit Entry toggles (singleton id=1)</td></tr>
</table>

<!-- ===================== 16 ===================== -->
<h2>16. End-to-End Operator Checklist</h2>
<ol>
  <li>Start application on port 6065.</li>
  <li>Login with active user email/password.</li>
  <li>Open Dashboard → verify tickets load.</li>
  <li>Create a task with assignee → check assignee inbox + CC (if Mail Send/CC ON).</li>
  <li>Edit task fields → check TASK_UPDATED email and audit.</li>
  <li>Delete task → verify it moves to Deleted Task list.</li>
  <li>Rollback deleted task → verify it returns to active lists.</li>
  <li>Open Email Audit Report → confirm SENT/FAILED logs.</li>
  <li>Toggle Mail Send OFF → perform action → confirm no new mail.</li>
  <li>Toggle Audit Entry OFF → perform action → confirm no new audit row.</li>
  <li>Logout → session cleared; login again.</li>
</ol>

<p class="meta">End of Detailed How-To-Work Guide — Companion short document: <strong>TaskManagement_Short_Guide.doc</strong></p>

</body>
</html>
